 alunni non le diano retta, costringendola a ricorrere all'aiuto di un gigantesco bidello per mantenere la disciplina in classe."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Sara, a young and diligent elementary school teacher, is about to marry Andrea, but two more men are competing for her. She needs a friendly hand to help her manage work, friends and love."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pTaAIb1gCdnMQgHmJBRIkMii70E.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ssuFYvTPbnrIXSKeVZydOvB0u4I.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":509940,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pTaAIb1gCdnMQgHmJBRIkMii70E.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pTaAIb1gCdnMQgHmJBRIkMii70E.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pTaAIb1gCdnMQgHmJBRIkMii70E.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pTaAIb1gCdnMQgHmJBRIkMii70E.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/haNA3IyTa4TWX2XKL4uRAyzFzIj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/haNA3IyTa4TWX2XKL4uRAyzFzIj.jpg","language":"it","width":1115,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vK5X3KnLTUI7KNZ8O68t95iSQ56.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vK5X3KnLTUI7KNZ8O68t95iSQ56.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8tMKelaLhkwjVNIqUCBihd4F2RS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8tMKelaLhkwjVNIqUCBihd4F2RS.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"t